Backport the Wayland click-to-exit implementation to Rofi 2.0.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/davatorium/rofi/commit/6d2a5281e45dee92dfbdaf6f9ba6081c4c608682
Unrelated formatting changes and unused declarations are omitted.
Also ignore bar exclusive zones so outside clicks on the bar dismiss the menu.
The transparent click surface is limited to the output hosting the menu.

